If you wield a long sword named Firebrand when the gods name you Hand
of Elbereth then Firebrand becomes Excalibur.  I have fought with
both, and Firebrand seems much better.  I am not sure if Excalibur
somehow did not get its damage bonus or if Firebrand is really a
better weapon against most monsters.  My +6 Firebrand always killed
nymphs in one hit.  My +6 Excalibur takes two hits.  Best to wield
some other long sword while praying if you care about such things.

-- Richard

